Request body for the same content: Claude Code 11,821 bytes, pi subscription shape 9,976, pi API-key shape 9,585.

**2. Request shape**

| | Claude Code 2.1.296 | pi-ai, subscription login | pi-ai, API key |
|---|---|---|---|
| Before the gist prompt | billing header, Agent SDK identity line | billing header with per-request hash, "You are Claude Code" line | nothing |
| Tool names | `mcp__chat__zoom`, `mcp__chat__date` | `_zoom`, `_date` | `zoom`, `date` |
| Before the view | reminder block with login email | nothing | nothing |
| After the message | environment block (cwd, OS, model, date) | nothing | nothing |
| Cache marks | all 4 used: identity, system, our view block, environment tail | 3 by default (last tool, system, last message block); all 4 caller-owned via `onPayload` | same as subscription |
| Default lifetime | 1 hour; 5 minutes via `CLAUDE_CODE_PROMPT_CACHE_TTL=5m` | 1 hour; 5 minutes via `cacheRetention: "short"` | 5 minutes; 1 hour via `"long"` |
| Changes between calls | nothing before the view | 5 hex characters of the billing hash in system[0] | nothing |

**3. E2 turn sequence, same bytes as round 1** (input-side cost per warm turn = input + W x write + 0.1 x read)

| Arm | Haiku, n=24 | Read share | Sonnet, n=8 | Read share |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Claude Code, 1-hour, W=2 (round 1, measured) | 8,090 | 96.4% | 7,386 | 95.4% |
| Claude Code, 5-minute, W=1.25 (measured this round) | 6,799 | 96.4% | 6,030 | 95.4% |
| pi, 1-hour (paper) | 7,359 | 97.1% | 6,655 | 96.3% |
| pi, 5-minute (paper) | 6,336 | 97.1% | 5,567 | 96.3% |

- Token counts were identical to round 1 on 24 of 24 Haiku turns and 8 of 8 Sonnet turns; only the write class changed (Haiku: 41,292 tokens all 5-minute against all 1-hour in round 1).
- The gist's figure is 98.6%.
- Mid-view change with 5-minute marks (Haiku, 9 calls) matched round 1 exactly: a middle-line change rewrote 27,034 tokens; a change 10 lines from the end after growth rewrote 2,401.
- 5-minute expiry (n=1, 15.9 KB view): read in full after 20 s; after a 330 s pause all 7,272 tokens were written again.

