experiment E5, the long replay: UniiChat (arm A, fresh call per message, gist prompt, view at 128,000/64,000, compaction view 32,000/16,000, Haiku-low background compactor up to 8 at once) against one continued Claude Code session (arm B, thinned as in round 1, auto-compaction untouched), both on Sonnet, same 260-turn synthetic engineering script on a scratch Python repository; then Opus late questions from the Sonnet end state; plus a stock-session arm B2.
