---
title: \"uniichat through claude code: a measured crossover and an untested memory claim\"
subtitle: \"two rounds of the endless-chat trial: cheaper turns over a longer replay, a cheaper compactor, and failures worth asking about.\"
study: optchat-claude-code-v0
status: evidence-local
author: \"zer0 research\"
date: \"october 12, 2026\"
mock_data: false
toc:
  - id: claim
    label: the claim and the trial
  - id: corrections
    label: what we got wrong in round 1
  - id: crossover
    label: the measured crossover
  - id: compactor
    label: the compactor sweep
  - id: correctness
    label: correctness and missed work
  - id: failures
